      <p>
        Claims routed for adjuster approval, with the decision and the layer the platform labelled
        that decision with. Refusals are shown as the server sent them.
      </p>

      <div style={card}>
        <h3 style={heading}>Route a claim for adjuster approval</h3>
        <p style={dim}>
          POST <code>{routing}</code>, then GET the same route.
        </p>
        <div style={{ display: "flex", gap: 8, flexWrap: "wrap" }}>
